        "rationale": "Under clause (ii) (F048:F050) and clause (iii) (F053), the parent and the local educational agency consenting in writing to excusal and the member submitting written input prior to the meeting are two distinct statutory requirements. The member's written input does not satisfy or replace the separate requirement of written parental consent.",
