          "F053"
        ],
        "rationale": "Clause (iii) (F053) explicitly provides that a parent's agreement under clause (i) (F046) shall be in writing. Incorporating this context quote and condition into C0004 accurately reflects the statutory requirements governing attendance excusal when an area is not being modified or discussed.",
        "verdict": "supported"
      },
      {
        "proposal_id": "P0001",
        "source_refs": [
          "F032:F043",
          "F053"
        ],
        "rationale": "Subparagraph (B) (F032:F043) defines the composition of the IEP Team, and clause (iii) (F053) applies only to parental agreement and consent under clauses (i) and (ii) of subparagraph (C). The source contains no requirement that every team member's participation requires prior written parental consent.",
        "verdict": "unsupported"
      },
